{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123292","id":4467982716,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABClABfA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123292","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123292.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123292.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123292","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123292/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123292/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123292/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/14f4feafb79176707d8cb2ba02679fc3b20cb7ff","number":123292,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add method `align_with` to Node3D","user":{"login":"LenaKotik","id":82910203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyOTEwMjAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82910203?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LenaKotik","html_url":"https://github.com/LenaKotik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LenaKotik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LenaKotik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LenaKotik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LenaKotik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LenaKotik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LenaKotik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LenaKotik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LenaKotik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LenaKotik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nIt gives users a simple interface to align objects to a vector (e.g. velocity) in a fast and efficient manner (without using expensive trig functions internally)\r\n\r\nAs a longtime user of the engine I really felt the need for this method. Of course there is an alternative: `look_at(destination+global_position)` but I would argue that it is a little unhandy and awkward for how often it comes up. Having a special method for it is cleaner and *probably* faster.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI rewrote `Basis::rotate_to_align` without using trig functions to make it cleaner and faster(?)\r\nThen I exposed it to client code through `Node3D.align_with(destination : Vector3, use_model_front : bool = false)`\r\n\r\nIf this PR gets accepted I will work on an equivalent method for `Node2D` to keep engine design symmetrical.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know what should be changed.\r\n\r\n> No AI used","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-07T21:53:06Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T20:28:05Z","closed_at":"2026-09-08T09:02:41Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3900b0bfbc4c30b3734a304e1ceefed116c4b713","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"LenaKotik:rotation-remove-trig","ref":"rotation-remove-trig","repo":{"id":13427